---
// Componente de Destaque de Serviços de Papelaria (Home Mobile)
---

<section class="px-4 py-12 bg-surface-container-lowest">
  <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-2 mb-8">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-primary-fixed text-on-primary-fixed px-3 py-1 cartoon-border rounded-full font-label-bold text-[10px] shadow-[1.5px_1.5px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] rotate-[-1deg]">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[10px]">print</span> Serviços rápidos
    </div>
    <h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md-mobile text-primary">Nossos Serviços de Impressão</h2>
    <p class="font-body-md text-xs text-on-surface-variant max-w-[280px]">Tudo o que você precisa para dar vida e durabilidade aos seus documentos e projetos.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 mb-10">
    <!-- Card 1: Impressões e Xerox -->
    <div class="thick-border rounded-2xl bg-white p-5 block-shadow-primary bg-primary-fixed/5">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-3">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-primary text-white border-2 border-black rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-[1.5px_1.5px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] rotate-[-3deg] shrink-0">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl">print</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-headline-md text-sm text-on-surface font-bold">Xerox e Impressões</h3>
      </div>
      <p class="font-body-md text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-4">A4 Preto e Branco ou Colorida em papel sulfite de alta qualidade. Impressão rápida e cópias sob demanda.</p>
      <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-[11px] font-label-bold bg-white border border-dashed border-on-surface/20 rounded-lg p-2.5">
        <span class="text-on-surface-variant">Xerox A4 P&B</span>
        <span class="text-primary font-bold">R$ 0,40 /pág</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 2: Papéis Especiais e Adesivos -->
    <div class="thick-border rounded-2xl bg-white p-5 block-shadow-tertiary bg-secondary-fixed/5">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-3">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-secondary text-on-secondary-fixed border-2 border-black rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-[1.5px_1.5px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] rotate-[3deg] shrink-0">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl">auto_awesome</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-headline-md text-sm text-on-surface font-bold">Adesivos e Papéis Especiais</h3>
      </div>
      <p class="font-body-md text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-4">Papel Fotográfico premium, Papel Adesivo brilhante, Vinil Transparente e papéis de alta gramatura de 60 quilos.</p>
      <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-[11px] font-label-bold bg-white border border-dashed border-on-surface/20 rounded-lg p-2.5">
        <span class="text-on-surface-variant">Papel Fotográfico</span>
        <span class="text-secondary font-bold">R$ 5,50 /fl</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 3: Plastificação e Encadernação -->
    <div class="thick-border rounded-2xl bg-white p-5 block-shadow-primary bg-tertiary-fixed/5">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-3">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-tertiary text-on-tertiary-fixed border-2 border-black rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-[1.5px_1.5px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] rotate-[-2deg] shrink-0">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl">book</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-headline-md text-sm text-on-surface font-bold">Plastificação e Acabamentos</h3>
      </div>
      <p class="font-body-md text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-4">Plastificação brilhante em polaseal para RG, CPF ou folha A4, e Encadernação Espiral com capa protetora.</p>
      <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-[11px] font-label-bold bg-white border border-dashed border-on-surface/20 rounded-lg p-2.5">
        <span class="text-on-surface-variant">Plastificação RG/CPF</span>
        <span class="text-tertiary-fixed-dim font-bold">R$ 4,00 /un</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="flex justify-center">
    <a 
      href="/mobile/servicos" 
      class="active-press w-full text-center py-3.5 bg-primary text-white border-2 border-black rounded-xl font-label-bold shadow-[3px_3px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] text-xs inline-block"
    >
      Ver Tabela de Preços Completa 📄
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
